Time-Keeper-Business

Business days, business hours and holidays on Time::Keeper: the next or the
nth business day, the business days or hours between two instants, SLA
deadlines, with holidays from the locale's weekend, from Date::Holidays and
its adapters, from rules, and from your own lists.

INSTALLATION

Time-Keeper 0.05 or later must be installed first: Time::Keeper::Business
builds against it.

    perl Makefile.PL
    make
    make test
    make install

